    ["1.众神之巅玩法为<Highlight>6v6模式</>，玩家需<Highlight>组建战队</>参与。\n2.进入众神之巅比赛场后，双方队伍出生在地图两边的准备区域中。玩法开启后，双方队伍可进入到战斗区域内进行战斗。\n3.在众神之巅玩法里，每个队伍拥有<Highlight>2次复活</>死亡队友的机会。"] = "1. The Peak of the Gods mode is a <Highlight> 6v6 mode </>, which requires players to <Highlight> form a team </> to participate. \n 2. After entering the Peak of the Gods arena, both teams spawn in the preparation areas on either side of the map. Once the mode begins, both teams can enter the Combat Area to engage in battle. \n 3. In the Peak of the Gods mode, each team has <Highlight> 2 opportunities to resurrect </> fallen teammates.",
